ng time to quarter past and to", "5-minute intervals", "24-hour clock introduction", "Duration: calculating time elapsed", "Calendars and timetables"]}, {"name": "Money", "subtopics": ["Recognising coins and notes", "Adding and subtracting money", "Making amounts in different ways", "Finding change", "Word problems with money"]}]}, {"name": "Geometry", "topics": [{"name": "Properties of Shapes", "subtopics": ["2D shapes: sides, vertices, right angles, symmetry", "3D shapes: faces, edges, vertices", "Identifying right angles", "Sorting shapes by properties", "Patterns and tessellations"]}, {"name": "Position and Direction", "subtopics": ["Using compass directions", "Following and giving directions", "Grid references", "Reflection and translation introduction"]}]}, {"name": "Statistics", "topics": [{"name": "Data Handling", "subtopics": ["Tally charts and frequency tables", "Pictograms with scale", "Bar charts", "Line graphs introduction", "Interpreting and comparing data", "Mean of small data sets"]}]}]$topics$,
